{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Grow Idle Land you gather Resources to grow your island bit by bit! Just by standing nearby, idling your way up and recruit workers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/f7931a519330d973cff0c2bc5f3dd448.poster.avif?t=1755684205\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/f7931a519330d973cff0c2bc5f3dd448.webm?t=1755684205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/f7931a519330d973cff0c2bc5f3dd448.mp4?t=1755684205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New buildings unlock new tools which unlock new paths to new upgrade possibilities! More Upgrades mean more Materials mean more to explore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/d14f6017af246c14f22b3591a33ed4a7.poster.avif?t=1755684205\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/d14f6017af246c14f22b3591a33ed4a7.webm?t=1755684205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/d14f6017af246c14f22b3591a33ed4a7.mp4?t=1755684205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an idle incremental game with simple moveable character in an isometric world. You idle by standing nearby or recruit workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Upgrades enable you to Destroy rocks, build bridges, defeat enemies. All that just by moving there. No actual combat, just cozy idle to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start on a small sky island and end up on a big connected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/85ba990a508a7db0554b357e06af79e4.poster.avif?t=1755684205\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/85ba990a508a7db0554b357e06af79e4.webm?t=1755684205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/85ba990a508a7db0554b357e06af79e4.mp4?t=1755684205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Idle Land in a nutshell:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An active incremental game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+ for permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple diverse areas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the definite End</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952030?t=1755684205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/7c548cb15849a3f553d562873d96d1a1366e91f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755684205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/4af6b1d09f3cb17901c20245313d019be4e18cd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755684205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/4af6b1d09f3cb17901c20245313d019be4e18cd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755684205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"note